---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import GeometricVisual from '../components/GeometricVisual.astro';
---

<Layout
  title='wo/men in tech · women in technical'
  description='面向技术与创造领域女性的慢节奏社群。在商业项目之外，做一些纯粹的事。'
  width='reading'
>
  <div class='page-root'>
    <div class='two-column-layout'>

      {/* ===== 左侧：品牌与宣言 (Brand anchor in signature brand purple) ===== */}
      <aside class='sidebar' id='about'>

        {/* 永久保留的核心标识：采用惊艳的经典品牌紫 */}
        <div class='brand-group'>
          <h1 class='site-title'>wo<span class='brand-slash'>/</span>men</h1>
          <p class='site-sub'>women in technical</p>
          <p class='site-zh'>"我们"</p>
        </div>

        {/* 中文版宣言 */}
        <div class='manifesto lang-zh'>
          <p>
            在每一个商业项目的空隙里，<br />
            总有一些东西是做给自己的。
          </p>
          <p>
            这里是那个地方。
          </p>
        </div>

        {/* 英文版宣言 */}
        <div class='manifesto lang-en'>
          <p>
            In between every commercial sprint,<br />
            there is always something we build for ourselves.
          </p>
          <p>
            This is that sanctuary.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class='sidebar-divider'></div>

        {/* 中文版面向群体 */}
        <div class='who-section lang-zh'>
          <span class='who-label'>面向群体</span>
          <p class='who-desc'>
            所有在技术与创造领域工作的女性——<br />
            产品、设计、工程、研究、写作……
          </p>
          <p class='who-note'>
            不需要特定头衔，<br />
            只是对作品本身有一点执念。
          </p>
        </div>

        {/* 英文版面向群体 */}
        <div class='who-section lang-en'>
          <span class='who-label'>CRAFTED FOR</span>
          <p class='who-desc'>
            All women creating across tech and design—<br />
            Product, Interaction, Engineering, Research, Writing...
          </p>
          <p class='who-note'>
            No specific titles required,<br />
            only a quiet devotion to the craft itself.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class='sidebar-footer'>
          <GeometricVisual type='subtle' height='72px' />
        </div>
      </aside>

      {/* ===== 右侧：核心展陈区 ===== */}
      <main class='content-main'>

        {/* 1. 我们做什么 */}
        <section class='content-block' id='events'>
          {/* 中文标题 */}
          <div class='section-heading-group lang-zh'>
            <div class='section-title-line'>
              <span class='section-serial'>01</span>
              <h2 class='section-main-title'>日常与创作机制</h2>
            </div>
            <p class='section-intro-text'>在商业流水线之外，守住纯粹的手艺与思考。</p>
          </div>

          {/* 英文标题 */}
          <div class='section-heading-group lang-en'>
            <div class='section-title-line'>
              <span class='section-serial'>01</span>
              <h2 class='section-main-title'>What We Do</h2>
            </div>
            <p class='section-intro-text'>Holding space for pure craft and deliberate contemplation outside commercial conveyor belts.</p>
          </div>

          {/* 中文展陈内容 */}
          <div class='editorial-panels-stack lang-zh'>
            <article class='editorial-panel'>
              <div class='panel-top'>
                <div class='panel-name-group'>
                  <h3 class='panel-title'>Coffee Chat</h3>
                </div>
                <span class='panel-badge'>双周 · 线上 / 杭州</span>
              </div>
              <p class='panel-desc'>
                不是 networking。<br />
                两三个人，把手里的咖啡喝完，谈谈最近在做的事——或者什么也不谈。
              </p>
            </article>

            <article class='editorial-panel'>
              <div class='panel-top'>
                <div class='panel-name-group'>
                  <h3 class='panel-title'>English Chat</h3>
                </div>
                <span class='panel-badge'>双周 · 线上不定期</span>
              </div>
              <p class='panel-desc'>
                用英语聊聊近期的作品细节、界面触感或代码考量。<br />
                放慢语速，为开口和思考留出充裕的呼吸余量。
              </p>
            </article>

            <article class='editorial-panel'>
              <div class='panel-top'>
                <div class='panel-name-group'>
                  <h3 class='panel-title'>作品 · Lab</h3>
                </div>
                <span class='panel-badge'>小组制 · 慢工出细活</span>
              </div>
              <p class='panel-desc'>
                把那个在心里存了许久的想法拿出来，和同频的伙伴一起慢慢雕琢。<br />
                给推敲留出时间，让灵感自然生长为经得起审视的器物。
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>

          {/* 英文展陈内容 */}
          <div class='editorial-panels-stack lang-en'>
            <article class='editorial-panel'>
              <div class='panel-top'>
                <div class='panel-name-group'>
                  <h3 class='panel-title'>Coffee Chat</h3>
                </div>
                <span class='panel-badge'>Biweekly · Online / Hangzhou</span>
              </div>
              <p class='panel-desc'>
                Not networking.<br />
                Two or three people finishing a cup of coffee, sharing recent pursuits—or simply enjoying the silence.
              </p>
            </article>

            <article class='editorial-panel'>
              <div class='panel-top'>
                <div class='panel-name-group'>
                  <h3 class='panel-title'>English Tech & Design Chat</h3>
                </div>
                <span class='panel-badge'>Biweekly · Virtual</span>
              </div>
              <p class='panel-desc'>
                Conversations around interface craft, typography, and code in English.<br />
                Slowing down to share, leaving ample room for unhurried thought.
              </p>
            </article>

            <article class='editorial-panel'>
              <div class='panel-top'>
                <div class='panel-name-group'>
                  <h3 class='panel-title'>Craft Lab</h3>
                </div>
                <span class='panel-badge'>Small Cohorts · Deliberate Work</span>
              </div>
              <p class='panel-desc'>
                Bring that quiet, long-cherished idea out into the open, shaping it patiently with peers who understand nuanced craft.<br />
                Giving work the time it deserves, letting intuition settle into enduring artifacts.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>

          {/* 精细化调整的底部手艺准则跳转栏 */}
          <div class='section-bottom-action'>
            <div class='action-lead-note'>
              <span class='gold-thread-dot'>✦</span>
              <span class='lang-zh'>保持极小规模 · 保护深度表达与留白</span>
              <span class='lang-en'>Intimate circles · Preserving deep craft and stillness</span>
            </div>
            <a href='/events' class='circle-arrow-link'>
              <span class='lang-zh'>阅读完整手艺准则与共建机制</span>
              <span class='lang-en'>Explore Craft Manifesto & Circle Norms</span>
              <span class='link-arrow'>⟶</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>

        {/* 2. 正在打磨的器物 · IN THE WORKSHOP (动态作品展陈与共建吸引点) */}
        <section class='content-block' id='workshop'>
          <div class='section-heading-group lang-zh'>
            <div class='section-title-line'>
              <span class='section-serial'>02</span>
              <h2 class='section-main-title'>正在打磨的器物 · Works in Progress</h2>
            </div>
            <p class='section-intro-text'>
              在商业流水线之外，我们正在慢节奏雕琢的数字器物与设计实验。给推敲充裕的时间，让每一处细节都立得住。
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class='section-heading-group lang-en'>
            <div class='section-title-line'>
              <span class='section-serial'>02</span>
              <h2 class='section-main-title'>Works in the Workshop</h2>
            </div>
            <p class='section-intro-text'>
              Digital artifacts and craft experiments in active development. Free from commercial rush, focused on enduring craft.
            </p>
          </div>

          {/* 角色视角快速切换 */}
          <div class='workshop-filter-bar' role='tablist' aria-label='作品视角筛选'>
            <button type='button' class='role-tab-btn is-active' data-role-filter='all'>
              <span class='lang-zh'>全部器物</span>
              <span class='lang-en'>All Artifacts</span>
            </button>
            <button type='button' class='role-tab-btn' data-role-filter='pm'>
              <span>PM · 商业与闭环</span>
            </button>
            <button type='button' class='role-tab-btn' data-role-filter='ixd'>
              <span>IxD · 触感与微动效</span>
            </button>
            <button type='button' class='role-tab-btn' data-role-filter='fe'>
              <span>FE · 鲁棒与离线工程</span>
            </button>
          </div>

          <div class='workshop-cards-stack'>
            {/* 器物: FrictionLog */}
            <article class='workshop-card' data-role='ixd fe'>
              <div class='card-header-line'>
                <div class='card-tag-group'>
                  <span class='work-status-badge'>原型推敲中 · 欢迎 PM / IxD</span>
                </div>
                <span class='work-triad-pills'>PM × IxD × FE</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class='work-title'>FrictionLog · 宁静慢节奏感知器</h3>
              <p class='work-summary lang-zh'>
                为复杂心智创造者设计的离线手写感知器物。杜绝社交算法与点赞刺激，专注捕获未经修饰的创作卡壳与顿悟时刻。
              </p>
              <p class='work-summary lang-en'>
                A local-first reflection tool for deep creators. Zero social algorithms, zero engagement hooks—holding space for genuine creative friction.
              </p>
              <div class='work-breakdown-grid'>
                <div class='breakdown-item'>
                  <span class='breakdown-label'>PM 支点</span>
                  <span class='breakdown-text'>非评价体系与微顿悟闭环</span>
                </div>
                <div class='breakdown-item'>
                  <span class='breakdown-label'>IxD 支点</span>
                  <span class='breakdown-text'>8px 纸感网格与金线刻痕</span>
                </div>
                <div class='breakdown-item'>
                  <span class='breakdown-label'>FE 支点</span>
                  <span class='breakdown-text'>PWA 离线存储与极速响应</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class='work-action-row'>
                <button type='button' class='btn-join-work' data-work-name='FrictionLog 慢节奏感知器'>
                  <span class='lang-zh'>认领共建角色 / 加入推敲 ⟶</span>
                  <span class='lang-en'>Co-build this artifact ⟶</span>
                </button>
              </div>
            </article>

            {/* 器物: TypeSpec */}
            <article class='workshop-card' data-role='ixd fe'>
              <div class='card-header-line'>
                <div class='card-tag-group'>
                  <span class='work-status-badge'>代码架构验证中 · 欢迎 FE</span>
                </div>
                <span class='work-triad-pills'>IxD × FE</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class='work-title'>TypeSpec · 手艺排版标尺</h3>
              <p class='work-summary lang-zh'>
                网页手艺人专用的黄金分割与衬线字距排版游标。让中英文混排拥有如同手制书籍一般的留白韵律与行气呼吸。
              </p>
              <p class='work-summary lang-en'>
                A modular golden-ratio typography inspection utility, bringing bookish calm and meticulous tracking to modern web screens.
              </p>
              <div class='work-breakdown-grid'>
                <div class='breakdown-item'>
                  <span class='breakdown-label'>PM 支点</span>
                  <span class='breakdown-text'>轻量即开即用体验</span>
                </div>
                <div class='breakdown-item'>
                  <span class='breakdown-label'>IxD 支点</span>
                  <span class='breakdown-text'>模块化尺度与黄金比例游标</span>
                </div>
                <div class='breakdown-item'>
                  <span class='breakdown-label'>FE 支点</span>
                  <span class='breakdown-text'>纯 CSS 变量流式驱动</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class='work-action-row'>
                <button type='button' class='btn-join-work' data-work-name='TypeSpec 手艺排版标尺'>
                  <span class='lang-zh'>认领共建角色 / 加入推敲 ⟶</span>
                  <span class='lang-en'>Co-build this artifact ⟶</span>
                </button>
              </div>
            </article>

            {/* 器物: Whisper Letter */}
            <article class='workshop-card' data-role='pm ixd'>
              <div class='card-header-line'>
                <div class='card-tag-group'>
                  <span class='work-status-badge'>概念草案阶段 · 欢迎自由加入</span>
                </div>
                <span class='work-triad-pills'>PM × IxD</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class='work-title'>Whisper Letter · 同行极简信笺</h3>
              <p class='work-summary lang-zh'>
                女性独立创造者之间的异步信笺交换协议。每次仅交换一份深度同行反馈，拒绝浮躁的信息流与客套夸奖。
              </p>
              <p class='work-summary lang-en'>
                An asynchronous craft critique protocol for independent creators. Exchange one deep, sincere feedback letter at a time.
              </p>
              <div class='work-breakdown-grid'>
                <div class='breakdown-item'>
                  <span class='breakdown-label'>PM 支点</span>
                  <span class='breakdown-text'>深度反馈互助闭环</span>
                </div>
                <div class='breakdown-item'>
                  <span class='breakdown-label'>IxD 支点</span>
                  <span class='breakdown-text'>火漆封蜡式异步折叠动效</span>
                </div>
                <div class='breakdown-item'>
                  <span class='breakdown-label'>FE 支点</span>
                  <span class='breakdown-text'>轻量端对端加密文本协议</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class='work-action-row'>
                <button type='button' class='btn-join-work' data-work-name='Whisper Letter 同行极简信笺'>
                  <span class='lang-zh'>认领共建角色 / 加入推敲 ⟶</span>
                  <span class='lang-en'>Co-build this artifact ⟶</span>
                </button>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </section>

        {/* 3. 近期安排 */}
        <section class='content-block' id='schedule'>
          {/* 中文标题 */}
          <div class='section-heading-group lang-zh'>
            <div class='section-title-line'>
              <span class='section-serial'>03</span>
              <h2 class='section-main-title'>近期安排</h2>
            </div>
            <p class='section-intro-text'>小规模交流，确保每一次相聚都有充裕的聆听与表达。</p>
          </div>

          {/* 英文标题 */}
          <div class='section-heading-group lang-en'>
            <div class='section-title-line'>
              <span class='section-serial'>03</span>
              <h2 class='section-main-title'>Upcoming Gatherings</h2>
            </div>
            <p class='section-intro-text'>Intimate circles ensuring ample time for unhurried listening and honest exchange.</p>
          </div>

          {/* 中文排期内容 */}
          <div class='editorial-panels-stack lang-zh'>
            <article class='editorial-panel'>
              <div class='panel-top'>
                <div class='panel-name-group'>
                  <h3 class='panel-title'>AI 时代，还剩下什么是属于自己的？</h3>
                </div>
                <span class='panel-badge status-open'>开放预约</span>
              </div>
              <p class='panel-desc'>
                探讨如何从工业流水线的焦虑中抽离，重新发现具有个人辨识度的表达。
              </p>
              <div class='panel-footer-meta'>
                <span>形式：杭州线下 + 线上同步</span>
                <span>双周周末 · 3-5 人</span>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class='editorial-panel'>
              <div class='panel-top'>
                <div class='panel-name-group'>
                  <h3 class='panel-title'>Show & Tell: Walk Me Through Something You Made</h3>
                </div>
                <span class='panel-badge status-open'>开放预约</span>
              </div>
              <p class='panel-desc'>
                特邀分享嘉宾用 40 分钟英文讲述一个喜欢的界面细节、动效或代码架构，安全试错，并设有充裕的 Q&A 交流环节。
              </p>
              <div class='panel-footer-meta'>
                <span>形式：线上视频连线 · 40 min 分享 + Q&A</span>
                <span>双周周中晚间</span>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>

          {/* 英文排期内容 */}
          <div class='editorial-panels-stack lang-en'>
            <article class='editorial-panel'>
              <div class='panel-top'>
                <div class='panel-name-group'>
                  <h3 class='panel-title'>In the Age of AI, What Truly Remains Ours?</h3>
                </div>
                <span class='panel-badge status-open'>Open for RSVP</span>
              </div>
              <p class='panel-desc'>
                Reflections on stepping away from automated pipeline anxiety to cultivate unmistakable personal expression.
              </p>
              <div class='panel-footer-meta'>
                <span>Format: Hangzhou (In-person) + Online link</span>
                <span>Biweekly Weekend · 3–5 Participants</span>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class='editorial-panel'>
              <div class='panel-top'>
                <div class='panel-name-group'>
                  <h3 class='panel-title'>Show & Tell: Walk Me Through Something You Made</h3>
                </div>
                <span class='panel-badge status-open'>Open for RSVP</span>
              </div>
              <p class='panel-desc'>
                Featuring a guest speaker sharing a favorite interface detail, micro-interaction, or code architecture in English for 40 minutes, in a supportive setting with an open Q&A session.
              </p>
              <div class='panel-footer-meta'>
                <span>Format: Virtual Studio · 40 min Talk + Q&A</span>
                <span>Biweekly Weekday Evening</span>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>

          <div class='section-bottom-action'>
            <div class='action-lead-note'>
              <span class='gold-thread-dot'>✦</span>
              <span class='lang-zh'>极小规模 · 保持 3-5 人深度倾听</span>
              <span class='lang-en'>Intimate gatherings · Capped at 5 participants</span>
            </div>
            <a href='/upcoming' class='circle-arrow-link'>
              <span class='lang-zh'>查看全部排期与答疑</span>
              <span class='lang-en'>View Full Schedule & Circle FAQ</span>
              <span class='link-arrow'>⟶</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>

        {/* 4. 预约加入 (前置极细金线手作表单) */}
        <section class='content-block' id='join'>
          {/* 中文标题 */}
          <div class='section-heading-group lang-zh'>
            <div class='section-title-line'>
              <span class='section-serial'>04</span>
              <h2 class='section-main-title'>预约交流 · 加入“我们”</h2>
            </div>
            <p class='section-intro-text'>如果你有共鸣，欢迎随时留下你的声音。</p>
          </div>

          {/* 英文标题 */}
          <div class='section-heading-group lang-en'>
            <div class='section-title-line'>
              <span class='section-serial'>04</span>
              <h2 class='section-main-title'>Join the Circle</h2>
            </div>
            <p class='section-intro-text'>If our ethos resonates with you, you are warmly invited to leave a note.</p>
          </div>

          <div class='form-wrapper'>
            <form id='home-join-form' class='quiet-form'>
              {/* 商业级反爬蜜罐与机器人陷阱 (视觉隐藏，爬虫秒填即被拦截) */}
              <input type='text' name='_hp' value='' tabindex='-1' autocomplete='off' aria-hidden='true' style='position:absolute;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;' />

              {/* 字段 1: 称呼 */}
              <div class='form-field'>
                <label class='field-label' for='home-name'>
                  <span class='lang-zh'>如何称呼你</span>
                  <span class='lang-en'>What should we call you</span>
                  <span class='field-hint lang-zh'>名字或习惯的称呼</span>
                  <span class='field-hint lang-en'>Name or preferred moniker</span>
                </label>
                <input
                  type='text'
                  id='home-name'
                  name='name'
                  placeholder='名字或习惯的称呼'
                  data-placeholder-zh='名字或习惯的称呼'
                  data-placeholder-en='Your name or preferred moniker'
                  required
                  autocomplete='off'
                />
              </div>

              {/* 字段 2: 前置细金线单选 */}
              <div class='form-field'>
                <label class='field-label'>
                  <span class='lang-zh'>你在从事的领域</span>
                  <span class='lang-en'>Your Primary Craft</span>
                  <span class='field-hint lang-zh'>单选</span>
                  <span class='field-hint lang-en'>Single choice</span>
                </label>
                <div class='quiet-check-list' role='radiogroup' aria-label='从事领域'>
                  <label class='quiet-check-row is-radio'>
                    <input type='radio' name='craft' value='design' checked />
                    <span class='check-indicator' aria-hidden='true'></span>
                    <div class='check-content'>
                      <span class='check-title lang-zh'>设计 · 视觉传达 / 交互体验 (IxD)</span>
                      <span class='check-title lang-en'>Design · Interaction & Visual Craft (IxD)</span>
                      <span class='check-note lang-zh'>视觉、触感与动效</span>
                      <span class='check-note lang-en'>Visuals, typography & micro-interactions</span>
                    </div>
                  </label>

                  <label class='quiet-check-row is-radio'>
                    <input type='radio' name='craft' value='product' />
                    <span class='check-indicator' aria-hidden='true'></span>
                    <div class='check-content'>
                      <span class='check-title lang-zh'>产品 · 逻辑推敲 / 独立孵化 (PM)</span>
                      <span class='check-title lang-en'>Product · Product Thinking & Independent Work (PM)</span>
                      <span class='check-note lang-zh'>痛点挖掘与体验闭环</span>
                      <span class='check-note lang-en'>Problem framing & human experience loops</span>
                    </div>
                  </label>

                  <label class='quiet-check-row is-radio'>
                    <input type='radio' name='craft' value='engineering' />
                    <span class='check-indicator' aria-hidden='true'></span>
                    <div class='check-content'>
                      <span class='check-title lang-zh'>工程 · 前端架构 / 独立全栈 (FE)</span>
                      <span class='check-title lang-en'>Engineering · Frontend Architecture & Systems (FE)</span>
